#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:634
msgid "Global language:"
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:635
msgid ""
"Use this drop down box to determine the default language for the document. This "
"setting is used by the hyphenation and spelling tools."
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:644
msgid "Automatic hyphenation"
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:645
msgid ""
"Check this box if you want KPresenter to automatically hyphenate long words "
"when it determines the word wrap in text frames. This is not set as default."
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:654
msgid "Create backup file"
msgstr "Ahiver copeye di såvrité"

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:655
msgid ""
"If checked, this will create a .<name>.kpr.autosave.kpr in the dir where your "
"file is. This backup file can then be used in case of a problem.\n"
"The backup file is updated everytime you save your document or everytime there "
"is an autosave."
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:661
msgid "Autosave (min):"
msgstr "Schapaedje tot seu (min.):"

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:662
msgid "No autosave"
msgstr "Nou schapaedje tot seu"

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:663
msgid "min"
msgstr "min"

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:664
msgid ""
"You can use this to adjust how often KPresenter saves a temporary file. If you "
"set this value to No autosave, KPresenter will not autosave. You can adjust the "
"autosave from 1 minute to 60 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:666
msgid "Starting page number:"
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:671
msgid ""
"You can change here the number for the first page. It is set to 1 per default.\n"
"Tip: this is helpful if you have split a single document into multiple files."
msgstr ""

#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:673
