#: kpresenter_dlg_config.cc:677
msgid ""
"Each KPresenter document has a default set of tab stops. If you add tab stops "
"to your document, the newly added tab stops override the default tabstops. You "
"can use this text box to define the spacing between default tab stops. As an "
"example, if you enter 1.5 in this text box, and the unit of measure is in "
"centimeters, then the first default tab stop will be located 1.5 cm to the "
"right of the left margin of the frame. The second default tab stop will be "
"located at 3 cm from the left margin, etc."
msgstr ""

